+# Agent Note: Preset-specific reply visibility
+
+Status: implemented
+
+English | [中文](2026-09-14-preset-reply-visibility.zh.md)
+
+## Problem
+
+Compact display treats intermediate Assistant replies as process details. For conversations whose replies are cumulative, folding those steps hides content the reader still needs.
+
+## Decision
+
+Client plugins register presets whose reply-bearing steps remain visible through chatPresentation. Registrations are observable effects and disappear with their owners. The Session preset selects this policy. Reasoning and Tool rows retain the existing process disclosure. Without registrations the list is empty, and Normal mode remains fully expanded.
+
+## Alternatives considered
+
+Changing the global preference also affects unrelated sessions. Disabling process folding exposes reasoning and tool details along with replies. Changing conversation records would mix presentation with model history.
+
+## Consequences
+
+The same view policy applies to streaming completion and restored records. Component tests cover preset selection, retained text, folded reasoning and Tool rows, and ordinary behavior. No Session, request or SDK format changes.
